1604
01:11:32.930 --> 01:11:38.190
By combining these different elements, I create each book as an individual piece of art.

1605
01:11:38.690 --> 01:11:41.190
They each have a title, a theme, and a voice.

1606
01:11:41.450 --> 01:11:46.290
Each book is full of blank pages for use as a journal, a photo album, a sketchbook, or

1607
01:11:46.290 --> 01:11:48.530
